<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - KN Energy raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - KN Energy raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co said analyst Lawrence Crowley raised his recommendation on KN Energy to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- KN shares were up 1/4 at 38 in late-morning trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
